%% title: Domestic Payment Lifecycle — State Machine
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> RECEIVED : POST /domestic-payments created

    RECEIVED --> VALIDATED : sanctions screen → CLEAR
    RECEIVED --> REJECTED : sanctions screen → HIT\n(SANCTIONS_HIT + AML case opened)
    RECEIVED --> RECEIVED : screen → POTENTIAL_HIT or outage\n(held for operator review)

    VALIDATED --> SENT_TO_CLEARING : clearing-service picks up
    VALIDATED --> CANCELLED : operator cancels before clearing

    SENT_TO_CLEARING --> SETTLED : inter-bank settlement confirmed
    SENT_TO_CLEARING --> RETURNED : payment returned by receiving bank

    REJECTED --> [*]
    CANCELLED --> [*]
    SETTLED --> [*]
    RETURNED --> [*]

    note right of RECEIVED
        fail-closed: outage keeps
        payment in RECEIVED
    end note

    note right of VALIDATED
        domain event emitted
        on every transition
    end note
